  "description_short": "Elevated dining in Upper Central Knysna with mountain views and a relaxed bar atmosphere.",
  "description_long": "Perched in Upper Central Knysna, Issaquena Falls Restaurant & Bar offers a welcome retreat from the bustle below. The setting takes advantage of the elevated position, with views stretching across the forested hillside. The atmosphere balances casual comfort with a touch of refinement, making it equally suited to a leisurely lunch or evening drinks at the bar.\n\nThe menu focuses on well-prepared classics with local touches, from hearty mains to lighter options that pair nicely with a selection from their bar. It's the kind of place where you can settle in for a proper meal or simply enjoy sundowners with a view. The restaurant is part of Issaquena Heights, tucked away enough to feel like a discovery while remaining easily accessible from central Knysna.\n\nWhether you're a local looking for a neighbourhood spot or a visitor exploring beyond the waterfront, the combination of mountain air, honest cooking, and welcoming service makes it worth the short drive uphill.",
